// expect-stdout: missing field `age` at $ (line 1, column 53)
// expect-stdout: unknown field `extra` at $.extra (line 1, column 74)
// expect-stdout: unknown variant `Hexagon` of `Shape` at $.Hexagon (line 1, column 14)
